+*RESPONSE*+

{color:#0747a6}Hi [insert drivers name]{color}

{color:#0747a6}We understand that you recently contacted Bolt querying whether we offer sick pay. In response to your query, Bolt is not required to provide sick pay, we believe that you have received all fees due to you in respect of services provided.{color}

{color:#0747a6}As you know, Bolt recently received news that the London Employment Tribunal has designated a group of drivers on the Bolt platform as "workers”. However, as we have previously communicated, there will be no immediate changes to how drivers operate on the platform.{color}

{color:#0747a6}Many thanks{color}

{color:#0747a6}Bolt {color}

